{"id":"d_main_37_04","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch37","label":"Chapter 37 · Struggle"},"label":"Spectacles Alliance","stage":"37-13 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_37_03","next":"d_main_37_05","speakers":{"anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","eyeri":"Eyeri","avistar":"Avistar"},"icons":{"anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","eyeri":"si_c440_00_s","avistar":"si_c441_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_37_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_1","text":"Now then, let's get this show on the road!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_inark","movie":null,"shown":["avistar","neon","anis","eyeri"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_2","text":"... Does anyone here know how to make videos, by any chance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_3","text":"Well, there goes all that confidence. And you were doing so well...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_4","text":"First and foremost, nothing is ever going to come out of that video. It's dry as dirt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_5","text":"If we want to get more eyeballs watching, we need to win people over with some other videos.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_6","text":"Remember when we made that promotional video for the Aegis Squad?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_7","text":"Yeah, but the Commander filmed all that. We only came up with the idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_8","text":"You mean the one that was shown at the boat party? That video is the stuff of legend! Unfortunately, it got a bit buried under all the press surrounding the terror attacks, but it's still become something of a cult favorite.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_9","text":"... I suppose that makes sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_10","text":"Anyway, does that mean there's no one here to knows how to make videos?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_11","text":"If that's the case, I guess we have no choice but to outsource. Let's see...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_12","text":"I know how to do it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_13","text":"Hmm?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_14","text":"You do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_15","text":"Yes. I've made several promotional videos in the past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_16","text":"Uh... Are you talking about the promos for Elysion? Those are all a bit too, how do I put this, fire and brimstone for my liking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_17","text":"No, those videos were made by the marketing team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_18","text":"Then what videos did you make?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_19","text":"Something similar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_20","text":"Why do I not entirely believe you...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_21","text":"Where I excel is the editing process, stitching together pre-existing footage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_22","text":"I'm not as strong when it comes to ideas.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_23","text":"So as long someone else points you in the right direction and provides some footage, you'll be good to go?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"avistar","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_24","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_25","text":"Then there's no problem at all! I'm practically a wellspring of ideas.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_26","text":"You know, a little modesty never hurt anyone...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_27","text":"That means our only problem is finding source material.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_28","text":"Yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_29","text":"What kind of video are we aiming for?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_30","text":"As the wellspring from which all ideas flow, I've got something in mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_32","text":"Oh. I forgot to take a picture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_33","text":"What picture?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_34","text":"Of Dorothy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_35","text":"... What are you up to now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_36","text":"Nothing strange, don't worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_37","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_38","text":"Eyeri.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_39","text":"Yes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_40","text":"If you get me a photo of Dorothy, I'll pretend I didn't see you secretly copying her fingerprints.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_41","text":"Oh, could you get me a voice sample while you're at it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_42","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_43","text":"You do realize that it's illegal to possess a Pilgrim's personal data, don't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_44","text":"... Fine. I'll get you what you need.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_45","text":"Thanks! And if you could be so kind, delete all that other information you gathered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_46","text":"... I will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_47","text":"What in the world are you two talking about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_48","text":"Should I explain?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_49","text":"No, I'll tell her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_50","text":"When Dorothy touched my phone, I copied her fingerprints.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_51","text":"I also secretly took several photos and recorded her voice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_52","text":"Dang. You're not just a fan. You're a fanatic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_53","text":"Not in the slightest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_54","text":"I was merely pretending to be a fan of hers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_55","text":"To what aim?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_56","text":"Since Dorothy is a Nikke, she must have been built using technology found in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_57","text":"I wanted to analyze her voice and fingerprints to uncover her past records.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_58","text":"To be precise, it's not exactly a fingerprint. More like a ballistic analysis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_59","text":"I wanted to figure out what her body is composed of, whether there is any damage, and if there is, if those damage patterns correlate with any specific areas or weapons.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_60","text":"My phone screen has a rudimentary analysis tool built into it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_61","text":"Since she only touched it briefly, I wasn't able to get any detailed information, but what I did get was still worth securing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_62","text":"Why do you say that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_63","text":"A Pilgrim conveniently pops up out of nowhere to save the Ark just in the nick of time, and now she's running her own TV channel?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_64","text":"I'd be crazy not to be suspicious of that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_65","text":"I thought investigating her past might reveal something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_66","text":"Everyone has some skeletons in their closet. That's our team motto.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_37_04_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"eyeri","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_37_04_67","text":"If we're able to uncover what Dorothy did in the past, we can better ascertain what her goals might be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":